                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Adidas's biggest competitive advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Multi-brand architecture (Performance + Originals + Style) + long-term athlete partnerships that compound brand equity over decades.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does Adidas spend on athlete sponsorship?</h3>
                                        <p>Estimated $3-4B annually across all athlete + team deals. 4-6% of revenue.</p>
                                        <h3>Can smaller brands apply Adidas's playbook?</h3>
                                        <p>Philosophy yes, scale no. Copy the discipline (regional focus, long-term partnerships, heritage + innovation), not the enterprise infrastructure.</p>
                                        <h3>What went wrong with Yeezy?</h3>
                                        <p>Over-dependence on one celebrity partnership. When ended, ~$2B annual revenue gap. Lesson: diversify cultural partnerships.</p>
